---
// A generic diagram of the work-systems architecture. No real data, no company specifics —
// just the shape described in text elsewhere on the site, made visual instead of read.
---

<div class="diagram-wrap">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 800 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="pipeline-diagram-title pipeline-diagram-desc" class="pipeline-svg">
        <title id="pipeline-diagram-title">Operations platform data flow</title>
        <desc id="pipeline-diagram-desc">
            Accounting, banking, and project sources feed a pipeline into one warehouse.
            The accounting system stays authoritative; the warehouse and dashboards are
            derived, dated views that can never outrank it.
        </desc>

        <!-- sources -->
        <g class="node node-source">
            <rect x="10" y="20" width="150" height="46" rx="8" />
            <text x="85" y="48">Accounting system</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-source">
            <rect x="10" y="107" width="150" height="46" rx="8" />
            <text x="85" y="135">Bank activity</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-source">
            <rect x="10" y="194" width="150" height="46" rx="8" />
            <text x="85" y="222">Project &amp; procurement docs</text>
        </g>

        <!-- arrows sources -> pipeline -->
        <path class="arrow" d="M160 43 H230" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M160 130 H230" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M160 217 H230" />

        <!-- pipeline -->
        <g class="node node-pipeline">
            <rect x="232" y="90" width="140" height="80" rx="8" />
            <text x="302" y="123">Pipeline</text>
            <text x="302" y="143" class="sub">validate · fail closed</text>
        </g>

        <!-- arrow pipeline -> warehouse -->
        <path class="arrow" d="M372 130 H442" />

        <!-- warehouse -->
        <g class="node node-warehouse">
            <rect x="444" y="75" width="150" height="110" rx="8" />
            <text x="519" y="118">Warehouse</text>
            <text x="519" y="140" class="sub">one store,</text>
            <text x="519" y="156" class="sub">one owner per fact</text>
        </g>

        <!-- arrows warehouse -> dashboards -->
        <path class="arrow" d="M594 100 H664" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M594 130 H664" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M594 160 H664" />

        <!-- operator dashboards -->
        <g class="node node-dash">
            <rect x="666" y="20" width="124" height="40" rx="8" />
            <text x="728" y="45" class="small">Warehouse health</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-dash">
            <rect x="666" y="110" width="124" height="40" rx="8" />
            <text x="728" y="135" class="small">Agent coordination</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-dash">
            <rect x="666" y="200" width="124" height="40" rx="8" />
            <text x="728" y="225" class="small">Ownership board</text>
        </g>
    </svg>
    <p class="diagram-caption">
        The accounting system stays authoritative. Everything to its right is a derived,
        dated view — it can explain the truth, but it never gets to outrank the source.
    </p>
</div>

<style>
    .diagram-wrap {
        border: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem;
        overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .pipeline-svg {
        width: 100%;
        min-width: 620px;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
    }
    .node rect {
        fill: #0d0d0d;
        stroke: #2a2a2a;
        stroke-width: 1;
    }
    .node-warehouse rect {
        fill: rgba(217, 163, 62, 0.08);
        stroke: var(--accent);
    }
    .node text {
        fill: #eee;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        text-anchor: middle;
        dominant-baseline: middle;
    }
    .node .sub {
        fill: #888;
        font-size: 10.5px;
    }
    .node .small {
        font-size: 11.5px;
    }
    .node-warehouse text:not(.sub) { fill: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
    .arrow {
        stroke: #3a3a3a;
        stroke-width: 1.5;
        fill: none;
        marker-end: url(#arrowhead);
    }
    .diagram-caption {
        margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        max-width: 640px;
    }
</style>

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
    <defs>
        <marker id="arrowhead" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="4" orient="auto">
            <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z" fill="#3a3a3a" />
        </marker>
    </defs>
</svg>
